cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Predictive Maintenance — Bearing Fault Prediction from Vibration Signals"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end machine-learning pipeline benchmarking classical feature-engineered
  baselines against a 1D-CNN, an LSTM temporal aggregator, and a physics-informed
  unsupervised autoencoder for bearing fault prediction on the NASA IMS dataset.
  Includes per-window stratified evaluation, leave-one-bearing-out cross-validation
  across 12 bearings, and a faithful reproduction of Marx & Gryllias 2022.
